      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Grrr. I don't like this. Or you. Or the things that have happened since you arrived. But-",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_102.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC17C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "To defy the Gray Man is to court death.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Bat_Vampire_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Reeves_DM-GRAVE_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675618,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Exactly. So orders then. Reeves tells me there are whispers of the Broken Branch on the nearest Mortal Plain. That's House of Cups territory...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_103.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC01F_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...But I can see how sending a mortal to investigate would be less ostentatious. Do as the Gray Man commands. And I hope you disappoint him.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Gargoyle_CommanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Commander_Ahk_To_DM-GRAVE_104.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675597,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC12A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard! Finally! You were gone for days. We were scrounging up a new glamour to come find you. What happened?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-GRAVE_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675533,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
